cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use geom-nmf in your work, please cite the GeomNMF methods paper
  (see "preferred-citation" below) and, optionally, this software.
type: software
title: "geom-nmf: Geometric non-negative matrix factorization via maximum-volume simplex fitting"
abstract: >-
  geom-nmf implements geometric non-negative matrix factorization (GeomNMF)
  for source apportionment. Assuming a simplex mixing model Y ≈ WH, it
  estimates source profiles as the vertices of the maximum-volume simplex
  inscribed in the convex hull of the row-normalized data, then recovers
  mixing weights and a source attribution matrix.
